- PASS. Smelt reports memory/smelts/2026-10-30-fifth-smelt*.md. Native notes: ~/.claude/projects/-home-haduong--agents/memory/ (pass explicitly; a worktree's slug differs). The prose_edits_on_main vs git.md conflict was resolved by rules/git.md:9 today: read current rules.
